## Case: r05-record-str-move
id: "ace.m1.r05"
module-name: "m1_r05"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

````auto
type Item { name Str; code int }
fn relay(move x Item) Item { return x.move }
fn main() int {
    let a Item = Item("x", 41)
    let b Item = relay(a.move)
    return b.code + b.name.len()
}
````

### VM result
check-id: "autovm"
final-newline: false

```text
