## Case: r08-static-record-method
id: "ace.m1.r08"
module-name: "m1_r08"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

````auto
type Counter {
    value int
    static fn new(n int) Counter { return Counter(n) }
    fn read() int { return .value }
}
fn main() int {
    let x Counter = Counter.new(42)
    return x.read()
}
````

### VM result
check-id: "autovm"
final-newline: false

```text
